# Exam track — Theme: Musek — Sub-lesson 3: Talking About It
# @question sentences: the examiner asks in Luxembourgish, the learner
# assembles the Luxembourgish answer (always en→lu).
#
# These are the user's real answers, gathered by interview on 2026-09-01 —
# do not "improve" or genericize them in a later editing pass. The point is
# that the learner rehearses what they will actually say in the Sproochentest.
# Real facts: rock/metal/folk/electro, In Flames, Spotify (no radio),
# headphones + car, dog walks, Rockhal 4-5x/year, Offspring at Luxexpo,
# Rock am Ring, wants Metallica/Rammstein/Muse, guitar but no patience,
# Okean Elzy / Onuka / Go-A from Ukraine, ROME from Luxembourg.
#
# The @fill blocks carry frames that recur across any topic: well-causal,
# wann-conditional (fronted), obwuel-contrast, léiwer-wéi comparative,
# fir…ze purpose, dofir-inversion, number, frequency adverb, datt-connector,
# language, wärenddeems, and a place name.

@lesson M1.03 "Talking About Music"

@word de Kënschtler = the artist
@word d'Sprooch = the language
@word d'Kassetten = the cassettes
@word d'Gedold = the patience
@word d'Instrument = the instrument
@word üben = to practise
@word benotzen = to use
@word fannen = to find
@word héieren = to hear
@word besichen = to visit
@word spadséieren = to go for a walk
@word den Hond = the dog
@word meeschtens = mostly
@word typesch = typical
@word fréier = in the past

@sentence
@question Lauschtert Dir gär Musek? Firwat?
@lu Jo, ech lauschteren immens gär Musek, well se mir Energie gëtt.
@en Yes, I really like listening to music, because it gives me energy.
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-lu Reen
@distractor-en cinema
@distractor-en rain

@sentence
@question Ass Musek wichteg fir Iech? Firwat?
@lu Jo, Musek ass ganz wichteg fir mech, well se mir heiansdo al Erënnerunge bréngt.
@en Yes, music is very important to me, because it sometimes brings back old memories.
@distractor-lu Suen
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-en money
@distractor-en cinema

@sentence
@question Wéi dacks lauschtert Dir Musek a fir wéi laang?
@lu Ech lauschteren all Dag Musek, dacks e puer Stonnen.
@en I listen to music every day, often for a few hours.
@distractor-lu ni
@distractor-lu seelen
@distractor-en never
@distractor-en rarely

@sentence
@question Wéini lauschtert Dir Musek?
@lu Ech lauschtere Musek, wann ech schaffen a wann ech mam Hond spadséiere ginn.
@en I listen to music when I work and when I go for a walk with the dog.
@distractor-lu danzen
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-en dance
@distractor-en cinema

@sentence
@question Wou lauschtert Dir gär Musek?
@lu Ech lauschtere gär Musek am Auto, op der Aarbecht an dobausse mam Hond.
@en I like listening to music in the car, at work and outside with the dog.
@distractor-lu Schoul
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-en school
@distractor-en cinema

@sentence
@question Nennt zwee Museksgenren, déi Dir gär hutt.
@lu Ech lauschtere gär Rock a Metal, an heiansdo och Volleksmusek an Elektro.
@en I like listening to rock and metal, and sometimes also folk music and electro.
@distractor-lu Bicher
@distractor-lu Sport
@distractor-en books
@distractor-en sport

@sentence
@question A wéi enger Sprooch lauschtert Dir Musek?
@lu Meeschtens op Englesch an op Ukrainesch, heiansdo och op Däitsch oder op Franséisch.
@en Mostly in English and in Ukrainian, sometimes also in German or in French.
@distractor-lu Spuenesch
@distractor-lu Portugisesch
@distractor-en Spanish
@distractor-en Portuguese

@sentence
@question Wéi ee Kënschtler lauschtert Dir de Moment?
@lu De Moment lauschteren ech vill In Flames, dat ass eng Metalband aus Schweden.
@en At the moment I listen to In Flames a lot, that is a metal band from Sweden.
@distractor-lu Radio
@distractor-lu Gittar
@distractor-en radio
@distractor-en guitar

@sentence
@question Wéi lauschtert Dir am léifste Musek?
@lu Am léifste lauschteren ech Musek mat Kopfhörer oder am Auto.
@en I like listening to music with headphones or in the car the most.
@distractor-lu Kassetten
@distractor-lu Tëlee
@distractor-en cassettes
@distractor-en TV

@sentence
@question Lauschtert Dir de Radio?
@lu Nee, ech lauschtere kee Radio, ech streame meng Musek léiwer.
@en No, I don't listen to the radio, I prefer streaming my music.
@distractor-lu Tëlee
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-en TV
@distractor-en cinema

@sentence
@question Benotzt Dir eng Streaming-Plattform, fir Musek ze lauschteren?
@lu Jo, ech benotze bal ëmmer Spotify, fir Musek ze streamen.
@en Yes, I almost always use Spotify to stream music.
@distractor-lu Radio
@distractor-lu Kassetten
@distractor-en radio
@distractor-en cassettes

@sentence
@question Wat ass besser: Apple Music oder Spotify?
@lu Fir mech ass Spotify besser, ech benotzen et bal ëmmer.
@en For me Spotify is better, I use it almost all the time.
@distractor-lu Radio
@distractor-lu deier
@distractor-en radio
@distractor-en expensive

@sentence
@question Wéi hutt Dir fréier Musek gelauschtert?
@lu Fréier hunn ech Musek op Kassetten, op CDen an als MP3 gelauschtert.
@en In the past I listened to music on cassettes, on CDs and as MP3.
@distractor-lu Computer
@distractor-lu Telefon
@distractor-en computer
@distractor-en telephone

@sentence
@question Hutt Dir als Kand gär Musek gelauschtert? Wa jo, wéi eng Musek?
@lu Jo, ech hu gär Musek gelauschtert, mee nëmmen déi Lidder, déi am Radio waren.
@en Yes, I liked listening to music, but only the songs that were on the radio.
@distractor-lu Concerten
@distractor-lu Tëlee
@distractor-en concerts
@distractor-en TV

@sentence
@question Hutt Dir an der Schoul sange geléiert?
@lu Nee, an der Schoul hunn ech net sange geléiert.
@en No, I did not learn to sing at school.
@distractor-lu danzen
@distractor-lu molen
@distractor-en dance
@distractor-en paint

@sentence
@question Spillt Dir en Instrument? Wann net, firwat net?
@lu Nee, ech spille keen Instrument, well ech keng Gedold hu fir ze üben.
@en No, I don't play an instrument, because I have no patience to practise.
@distractor-lu Radio
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-en radio
@distractor-en cinema

@sentence
@question Wëllt Dir en Instrument léieren?
@lu Jo, ech wëll gär Gittar spille léieren.
@en Yes, I would like to learn to play the guitar.
@distractor-lu Radio
@distractor-lu Concert
@distractor-en radio
@distractor-en concert

@sentence
@question Gitt Dir dacks op Concerten?
@lu Jo, ech gi véier oder fënnef Mol am Joer op e Concert, dacks an d'Rockhal.
@en Yes, I go to a concert four or five times a year, often to the Rockhal.
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-lu seelen
@distractor-en cinema
@distractor-en rarely

@sentence
@question Op wéi engem Concert waart Dir fir d'lescht?
@lu Fir d'lescht ware mir op engem Concert vun Offspring bei der Luxexpo.
@en Last time we were at a concert by Offspring near the Luxexpo.
@distractor-lu Festival
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-en festival
@distractor-en cinema

@sentence
@question Hutt Dir schonn eemol e Museksfestival besicht? Wou?
@lu Jo, ech war schonn op ville Festivallen, fir d'lescht op Rock am Ring.
@en Yes, I have already been to many festivals, most recently at Rock am Ring.
@distractor-lu Tëlee
@distractor-lu Radio
@distractor-en TV
@distractor-en radio

@sentence
@question Wéi eng Band wëllt Dir onbedéngt live gesinn?
@lu Ech wëll onbedéngt Metallica, Rammstein a Muse live gesinn.
@en I absolutely want to see Metallica, Rammstein and Muse live.
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-lu Radio
@distractor-en cinema
@distractor-en radio

@sentence
@question Wat ass typesch Musek aus Ärem Heemechtsland?
@lu Aus der Ukrain ass Pop-Rock wéi Okean Elzy typesch, mee nei Bands mësche Folk mat Elektro.
@en From Ukraine, pop-rock like Okean Elzy is typical, but new bands mix folk with electro.
@distractor-lu Gittar
@distractor-lu Concert
@distractor-en guitar
@distractor-en concert

@sentence
@question Kennt Dir lëtzebuergesch Museker?
@lu Jo, ech kenne ROME, an hie kënnt aus Lëtzebuerg.
@en Yes, I know ROME, and he comes from Luxembourg.
@distractor-lu Sänger
@distractor-lu Radio
@distractor-en singer
@distractor-en radio

@sentence
@question Ass Musek lauschteren Ärer Meenung no en Hobby?
@lu Jo, ech mengen, datt Musek lauschteren en Hobby ass.
@en Yes, I think that listening to music is a hobby.
@distractor-lu Sport
@distractor-lu Aarbecht
@distractor-en sport
@distractor-en work

@sentence
@question Wéi a wou fannt Dir nei Musek?
@lu Ech fannen nei Musek meeschtens op Spotify, an heiansdo héieren ech nei Bands op engem Festival.
@en I mostly find new music on Spotify, and sometimes I hear new bands at a festival.
@distractor-lu Kino
@distractor-lu Tëlee
@distractor-en cinema
@distractor-en TV

